    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I see math as a tool for understanding the world, especially through physics and problem-solving. I enjoy applying it to real-life scenarios like optimizing routes while running or analyzing patterns in bird behavior. It’s practical but not my main focus—more of a side interest that connects to my hobbies.",
