    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Yes, I used AI tools like ChatGPT to check my homework and understand complex topics. It helped clarify concepts quickly, but I had to be careful not to rely too much on it. Overall, it was a good supplement—I learned to use it as a helper, not a replacement.",
